                                                "sense_id": "d5220c7a-2d5e-331b-8416-96aa0ed286a7",
                                                "text": "Though he possess sweet babes and loving wife,\nA home of peace by loyal friendships cheered,\nAnd love them more than death or happy life,"
                                            }
